msgid "<if ($n2 == 1)>One member<else><capitalize><if $n2><if ($n2 <= 10)><switch $n2><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n2></if><else><num $n2></if></capitalize> members</if> of your party <if ($n2 == 1)>has<else>have</if> already progressed beyond <sheet InstanceContent $n1 3>. As a result, <if ($n3 == 1)><if $n3><if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3></if><else><num $n3></if> treasure coffer<else><if $n3><if ($n3 <= 10)><switch $n3><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n3></if><else><num $n3></if> treasure coffers</if> will pop upon completion. Do you wish to proceed?"
